3.3 Investment Manager Oversight Duties: 
• Assist in the development of RFPs, RFQs, RFIs and any other data gathering
requirements for competitive search processes;
• Undertake initial screening of responses in connection with any search process;
• Collect and periodically make available investment manager information from your
database and other sources including information relating to referrals from the City 
Treasurer and her staff;

