• Assist in establishing and/or revising manager guidelines;
• Support and provide on-going monitoring of investment managers performance and 
operations;
• Provide on-going monitoring of investment manager performance reporting standards
compliance;
• Provide access to analytical software and tools;
• Monitor manager fees and provide comparative peer metrics;
• Monitor trading programs and transaction costs.
3.4 Performance Reporting and Analysis Duties: 
• Provide performance reporting on a monthly and quarterly basis and on an as
needed basis;
• Compare total portfolio investment performance to custom policy benchmarks (see 
above); 
• Include investment analytics and attribution analyses at the manager, asset class 
and total fund levels in quarterly reporting;
• Provide ongoing benchmark evaluation, implementation, and analysis;
• Provide access to performance and attribution analytical software, if any;

