• Provide ad hoc reporting, as requested by Treasurer and staff.
 3.5 Training, Education and Information:
• Participate in ad hoc workshops on specific issues designated by the City Treasurer;
• Develop and provide access to educational materials and investment education on a
periodic basis or as requested; 
• Provide access to all firm research, including white papers and research staff;
• Report, in a timely manner, any significant changes in the firm’s organizational 
structure and staffing.
 3.6 Diversity, Equity and Inclusion:
• Develop and maintain a database of diverse managers for inclusion and 
identification in all searches conducted for the City Treasurer’s Office and monitor 
and report on City Treasurer’s Office’s investment manager diversity on an 
ongoing basis. 
